<title>HUNGARY: Hungary c.bank reserves drop slightly to $9.75 bln.</title>
<headline>Hungary c.bank reserves drop slightly to $9.75 bln.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Hungary's reserves stood at $9.75 billion at end-December, down from $9.81 billion at end-November, the bank said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>HUNGARY RESERVES ($ million)</p>
<p>					Dec 1996	 Nov 1996</p>
<p> International reserves	  9,750.9	   9,812.4</p>
<p>	Of which gold		   37.3		37.5</p>
<p>	Other foreign assets	 808.3	     469.0</p>
<p>NOTE - The NBH values gold at London market prices.</p>
<p>((-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327-4040 ))</p>
